#: script/events.js:1320
msgid " and "
msgstr "以及"

#: script/outside.js:1709
#: script/outside.js:1759
msgid " and {0} "
msgstr " 和 {0} "

#: script/room.js:496
msgid " builder says the villagers could make steel, given the tools."
msgstr " 建造者说，只要有工具，村民们就能炼出钢铁。"

#: script/outside.js:1705
#: script/outside.js:1755
msgid ", {0} "
msgstr "，{0} "

#: script/events/road.js:871
#: script/localization.js:7
#: script/room.js:1334
#: script/space.js:578
msgid "..."
msgstr "……"

#: script/space.js:819
msgid "...."
msgstr "……"

#: script/graveyard.js:65
msgid "\"a physician. she treated both sides and said so out loud.\""
msgstr "“一位医者。她救治双方，而且大声说出这一点。”"

#: script/swamp.js:81
msgid "\"and then a door was opened. i was not there. i have had a great deal of time to be grateful that i was not there.\""
msgstr "“后来一扇门被打开了。我不在场。我有大把时间庆幸自己不在场。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:110
msgid "\"curse the profane for all time, and curse the exile for releasing them.\""
msgstr "“愿亵渎者永受诅咒，愿放逐者因释放了他而永受诅咒。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:41
msgid "\"curse the profane, who was told what would happen and did it anyway.\""
msgstr "“愿亵渎者受诅咒，他早知后果，仍一意孤行。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:76
#: script/graveyard.js:81
#: script/graveyard.js:86
#: script/graveyard.js:91
#: script/graveyard.js:96
msgid "\"curse the profane.\""
msgstr "“愿亵渎者受诅咒。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:35
msgid "\"fell in the first bombardment, with the roof of his own house.\""
msgstr "“死于第一轮轰炸，和自家的屋顶一起坍塌。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1863
msgid "\"forcing your will through violence? you have only proven why you deserve to be shunned.\""
msgstr "“用暴力强加你的意志？你只是证明了自己为何该被摒弃。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:40
msgid "\"four years old. the sky came down.\""
msgstr "“四岁。天空坍塌了。”"

#: script/swamp.js:137
msgid "\"go home, commander.\""
msgstr "“回家吧，指挥官。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:60
msgid "\"he stood at the profane's shoulder for nine years.\""
msgstr "“他在亵渎者身边侍立了九年。”"

#: script/space.js:739
msgid "\"i could never have done any of this without you. but you would never understand.\""
msgstr "“没有你，我根本做不成这一切。但你永远不会明白。”"

#: script/swamp.js:93
msgid "\"i have made my peace with never leaving. i recommend it. it is the only thing out here that gets easier.\""
msgstr "“我已经与永不离开这件事和解了。我建议你也这样做。这是这片荒野上唯一会变容易的事。”"

#: script/swamp.js:147
msgid "\"i have made my peace with never leaving. you have not. that is the whole of the difference between us.\""
msgstr "“我已经与永不离开这件事和解了。你没有。这就是我们之间的全部区别。”"

#: script/space.js:690
msgid "\"i told you i had made my peace with never leaving,\" he says. \"i would like to formally revise that.\""
msgstr "“我告诉过你，我已经与永不离开这件事和解了，”他说，“我想正式修改这句话。”"

#: script/swamp.js:75
msgid "\"i was second. whatever he signed, i countersigned.\""
msgstr "“我是副手。无论他签了什么，我都会副署。”"

#: script/swamp.js:135
msgid "\"keep it. you will not remember this and you will need something to be holding when you work it out again.\""
msgstr "“留着它。你不会记得这件事，等你再次想明白时，会需要有东西握在手里。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:70
msgid "\"lost with all hands, orbital action.\""
msgstr "“轨道作战中，全员阵亡。”"

#: script/easterEggs.js:127
msgid "\"nothing.\""
msgstr "“没什么。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:75
msgid "\"one of the many. there was not time to find out which.\""
msgstr "“众多人之一。没时间弄清是哪一个了。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:51
msgid "\"one of the nine reported it. the profane had her executed inside the week.\""
msgstr "“九人之一揭发了此事。亵渎者不到一周就将她处决了。”"

#: script/easterEggs.js:134
msgid "\"one weighed down with the weight of the stars in a prison without walls.\""
msgstr "“一个被群星的重量压垮的人，被囚禁在一座没有墙壁的监狱里。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1884
msgid "\"perhaps judgement will not be everlasting.\""
msgstr "“也许审判不会是永恒的。”"

#: script/swamp.js:125
msgid "\"she has been out here as long as i have and she did not have to be.\""
msgstr "“她在这荒野里待的时间和我一样长，而她本不必如此。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:50
msgid "\"she said in a room of nine people that the war should stop.\""
msgstr "“她在九人的房间里说，战争应该停止。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:30
msgid "\"she went out when the call came. she believed it. that was the whole of her crime.\""
msgstr "“号召一来，她就出发了。她相信了。这就是她的全部罪行。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3256
#: script/events/setpieces.js:3340
msgid "\"spend it on what will still be here after us.\""
msgstr "“把它用在我们之后仍会留存的东西上。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:31
msgid "\"taken in the rising. curse the profane.\""
msgstr "“死于起义之中。愿亵渎者受诅咒。”"

#: script/easterEggs.js:128
msgid "\"that is not a judgement.\""
msgstr "“那不是一种审判。”"

#: script/swamp.js:131
msgid "\"that is the part i had to make peace with. not that it was cruel. that it stopped being about us a very long time ago and did not stop.\""
msgstr "“这是我不得不和解的部分。不是因为它残酷。而是它早在很久以前就与我们无关了，却从未停止。”"

#: script/swamp.js:120
msgid "\"that is worse. i know it is worse. i countersigned all of it and it is worse for me too.\""
msgstr "“那更糟。我知道那更糟。这一切我都副署了，对我来说也更糟。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:55
msgid "\"the convoys stopped coming. it took the settlement eleven weeks.\""
msgstr "“运输队不再来了。这个定居点花了十一周才明白过来。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:66
msgid "\"the profane had that called treason. curse him.\""
msgstr "“亵渎者把那称作叛国。愿他受诅咒。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:56
msgid "\"the profane needed the lanes for something else. curse him for it.\""
msgstr "“亵渎者把那些航道另作他用。愿他因此受诅咒。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2055
msgid "\"the watcher does not pass judgement.\""
msgstr "“观察者不做审判。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2056
msgid "\"the watcher observes judgement.\""
msgstr "“观察者只观察审判。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1991
msgid "\"the watcher would not forbid someone from observing their own fate.\""
msgstr "“观察者不会禁止一个人观察自己的命运。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:61
msgid "\"the wound is in his back. curse the profane, who could not even do that much to a man's face.\""
msgstr "“伤口在他背上。愿亵渎者受诅咒，他连这点事都不敢当面对人做。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2364
msgid "\"there is a fire at home. it is still lit. that is all i have to offer and i am offering it.\""
msgstr "“家里有一炉火。它还燃着。这就是我能给的一切，而我愿意给你。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2363
msgid "\"there is nothing in there but pain. i am not going to pretend i can stop you.\""
msgstr "“那里面除了痛苦什么也没有。我不会假装自己能阻止你。”"

#: script/swamp.js:115
msgid "\"there is nothing left in you to lose. and some of what you have got left, you are holding shut on purpose. i can see you doing it.\""
msgstr "“你已经没有什么可失去的了。而你剩下的一部分，是你故意紧闭着的。我看得出你在这样做。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:46
msgid "\"there was no end to them. the profane never intended one.\""
msgstr "“他们没有尽头。亵渎者从未打算给他们一个。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:36
msgid "\"there was no warning given. the profane did not consider one necessary.\""
msgstr "“没有发出警告。亵渎者认为没有必要。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3716
msgid "\"THEY SHOWED ME A THING THAT CANNOT BE TRUE. I KNEW IT WAS TRUE THE MOMENT I SAW IT. I HAVE NOT BEEN ABLE TO PUT IT DOWN SINCE.\""
msgstr "“他们给我看了一样不可能为真的东西。我一看见它就知道它是真的。从那以后我就再也放不下了。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:71
msgid "\"they were not told what they were firing on. curse the profane, who was.\""
msgstr "“他们不知道自己在朝什么开火。愿亵渎者受诅咒，他是知道的。”"

#: script/space.js:696
#: script/space.js:701
#: script/space.js:723
msgid "\"to know someone is to love someone. you cannot help who you love.\""
msgstr "“了解一个人，便是爱一个人。你无法选择自己爱谁。”"

#: script/graveyard.js:45
msgid "\"twenty-one years in the wars. he was released twice and recalled twice.\""
msgstr "“在战争中度过了二十一年。他两次退役，又两次被召回。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3254
msgid "\"we did not arrive together and we will not leave together. the water is one water.\""
msgstr "“我们不是一同到来的，也不会一同离去。水，是同一片水。”"

#: script/swamp.js:69
msgid "\"we did not think we were monsters. that is not a defence. it is just what was true.\""
msgstr "“我们不认为自己是怪物。这不是辩解。这只是事实。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2020
msgid "\"we do not ask the watcher to change fate, merely to help us understand it.\""
msgstr "“我们不求观察者改变命运，只求他帮我们理解命运。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2019
msgid "\"we help those in need if we are able, but our path is to watch, not to intervene.\""
msgstr "“若我们能够帮助，我们会帮助有需要的人，但我们的道是观察，而非干预。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1953
msgid "\"we help those in need if we are able.\""
msgstr "“若我们能够帮助，我们会帮助有需要的人。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1883
msgid "\"we perceive the penitent.\""
msgstr "“我们感知到了悔悟者。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1992
msgid "\"we would be poor students of it if we did.\""
msgstr "“若我们那样做，便算不上这门学问的好学生了。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1994
msgid "\"what is down there is not a secret. it is only difficult.\""
msgstr "“下面的东西不是秘密。它只是艰难。”"

#: script/swamp.js:87
msgid "\"you are holding its mark in your hand. that is where it ended up.\""
msgstr "“你手中握着它的印记。它最终就落在了那里。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2079
msgid "\"you are who you always are. this is why you are shunned.\""
msgstr "“你一直是你自己。这就是你被摒弃的原因。”"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1703
msgid "\"you did not bring anybody either.\""
msgstr "“你也没有带任何人来。”"

#: script/swamp.js:107
msgid "\"you have the scar. you always have the scar.\""
msgstr "“你身上有那道疤。你一直都有那道疤。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2760
msgid "\"you may observe your fate.\""
msgstr "“你可以观察你的命运。”"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2761
msgid "\"you may rarely change it.\""
msgstr "“你很少能改变它。”"

#: script/swamp.js:109
msgid "\"you never remember. i have stopped finding that surprising and i have not stopped minding it.\""
msgstr "“你从不记得。我早已不再为此感到惊讶，却从未停止在意。”"

#: script/room.js:251
msgid "{0} could help hunt, given the means"
msgstr "{0} 若有合适的手段，便能帮忙狩猎"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3457
msgid "{0} of the three are dark now. what is left is still lit."
msgstr "三者中已有 {0} 熄灭。剩下的仍亮着。"

#: script/engine.js:1271
msgid "{0} per {1}s"
msgstr "{0} /{1}秒"

#: script/outside.js:1701
msgid "{0} traps contain {1} "
msgstr "{0} 个陷阱里有 {1} "

#: script/outside.js:1751
msgid "{0} uber traps contain {1} "
msgstr "{0} 个超级陷阱里有 {1} "

#: script/world.js:376
msgid "{0}:{1}"
msgstr "{0}:{1}"

#: script/events.js:1792
msgid "*** EVENT ***"
msgstr "*** 消息 ***"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2994
msgid "\\u2C00 \\u2C01 \\u2C02 \\u2C03 \\u2C04 \\u2C05, the same glyphs cut into the ruins, going back to before the infinite expanse."
msgstr "\\u2C00 \\u2C01 \\u2C02 \\u2C03 \\u2C04 \\u2C05，与刻在废墟中的符文相同，可追溯到无尽苍穹之前。"

#: script/events/outside.js:233
msgid "1 medicine"
msgstr "1支药剂"

#: script/events/encounters.js:967
#: script/events/encounters.js:975
msgid "11B-X-1371"
msgstr "11B-X-1371"

#: script/events/encounters.js:976
msgid "11B-X-1371 is still and silent."
msgstr "11B-X-1371 静止无声。"

#: script/events/outside.js:336
msgid "3 medicine"
msgstr "3 份药品"

#: script/events/room.js:465
msgid "300 wood, paid up front"
msgstr "300 木材，预付"

#: script/events/room.js:476
msgid "500 wood, paid on completion"
msgstr "500 木材，完工后支付"

#: script/events/path.js:81
msgid "a bale goes over and is halfway to the treeline before anyone can get to it."
msgstr "一捆货物翻倒，还没等谁赶到就已滚到树线一半的地方。"

#: script/village.js:200
msgid "a band of scavengers comes out of the treeline in loose order, and they are not here to talk."
msgstr "一伙拾荒者从树线边缘散乱地走出来，他们不是来谈话的。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:307
msgid "a bank of cells, most of them dead"
msgstr "一排电池，大多已经报废"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:304
msgid "a bank of recesses runs the length of the wall, each one holding a slotted cell."
msgstr "一排凹槽沿墙壁延伸，每一个都嵌着一块电池。"

#: script/world.js:1374
msgid "A Barren World"
msgstr "荒芜世界"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4980
msgid "a battered highway sign stands guard at the entrance to this once-great city."
msgstr "破损的公路标识竖立在这个曾经伟大的城市入口"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6967
msgid "a battle was fought here, long ago."
msgstr "很久之前这里发生了战斗"

#: script/events/outside.js:441
msgid "A Beast Attack"
msgstr "野兽来袭"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4575
msgid "a beast charges out of a ransacked classroom."
msgstr "一头巨兽冲出教室"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4405
msgid "a beast stands alone in an overgrown park."
msgstr "一只野兽站在一个杂草丛生的公园中央"

#: script/events/encounters.js:962
msgid "a beast, wilder than imagining, erupts out of the foliage"
msgstr "一只凶怪以超乎想象的狂野从林中扑出"

#: script/events/room.js:334
msgid "a beggar arrives"
msgstr "乞丐来了"

#: script/events/room.js:331
msgid "a beggar arrives."
msgstr "乞丐徘徊在门前"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2653
msgid "a bench, and a row of instruments still under power, all of them pointed at the same kind of measurement."
msgstr "一张工作台，一排仍在通电的仪器，全都指向同一种测量。"

#: script/lab.js:309
msgid "a bench, wiped down. the tools on it are laid out in order of size."
msgstr "一张工作台，已经擦拭过。上面的工具按大小排列。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2670
msgid "a biohazard furnace, recently used"
msgstr "一座生物危害焚化炉，最近使用过"

#: script/events/room.js:183
msgid "a bundle of sticks lies just beyond the threshold, wrapped in coarse furs."
msgstr "一捆用粗糙的毛皮扎起来的柴火斜倚在门槛上"

#: script/events/room.js:185
msgid "a bundle sits just outside, tied with a knot that took somebody a while."
msgstr "门外放着一个包裹，绳结打得很花时间。"

#: script/events/road.js:500
msgid "a buried water cache"
msgstr "一处埋藏的储水点"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2992
msgid "a cabinet of logs, in more hands and more languages than one observatory should have needed."
msgstr "一柜航海日志，笔迹和语言之多，远超一座观测站所需。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:837
msgid "a cacophony of decrepit machinery fills the room."
msgstr "破败机械的刺耳噪音充斥着整个房间。"

#: script/events/road.js:31
msgid "A Cairn"
msgstr "一座石冢"

#: script/events/road.js:42
msgid "a cairn stands beside the track"
msgstr "小径旁立着一座石冢"

#: script/events/road.js:1624
msgid "a camp that was finished with rather than abandoned"
msgstr "一处被用尽而非被遗弃的营地"

#: script/events/road.js:1620
msgid "a camp, laid out properly, with a windbreak and a latrine trench and a fire ring used a great many times."
msgstr "一处布置整齐的营地，有防风墙、厕所沟渠，还有一个用过许多次的火圈。"

#: script/events/road.js:378
msgid "a camp, not long abandoned. the ash is grey through but the ground under it is still dry."
msgstr "一处不久前废弃的营地。灰烬已经发灰，但下面的地面仍是干的。"

#: script/outside.js:798
msgid "A Campsite"
msgstr "一处营地"

#: script/events/encounters.js:885
msgid "A Carrion Drone"
msgstr "一台食腐无人机"

#: script/events/room.js:1138
msgid "a cartographer is making a register"
msgstr "一位制图师正在编制名录"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3960
msgid "a cave lizard attacks"
msgstr "一头洞穴蜥蜴袭来"

#: script/prison.js:208
msgid "a cell door, open, the inside as clean as the corridor."
msgstr "一扇牢门，敞开着，内部和走廊一样干净。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3565
msgid "a cell, set into the wall of the assay hall, and much newer than the hall."
msgstr "一间牢房，嵌在检测厅的墙壁里，比大厅新得多。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:841
msgid "A Chain-Gang Revenant"
msgstr "一名囚徒亡魂"

#: script/lab.js:326
msgid "a chair bolted to the floor. the bolts are recent work."
msgstr "一把螺栓固定在地板上的椅子。螺栓是新装的。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:710
msgid "A Chitinous Elk"
msgstr "一头甲壳麋鹿"

#: script/events/encounters.js:747
msgid "a chitinous elk charges with its thick armored hide."
msgstr "一头甲壳麋鹿顶着厚重的护甲外皮发起冲锋。"

#: script/village.js:172
msgid "a chitinous elk walks into the middle of the settlement and does not stop walking."
msgstr "一头甲壳麋鹿走进定居点中央，脚步没有停下。"

#: script/events/road.js:371
msgid "A Cold Camp"
msgstr "一处冷灶营地"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1311
msgid "a colossal shape emerges silently from the deep forest."
msgstr "一个庞然大物无声地从深林中现身。"

#: script/events/road.js:886
msgid "A Column of Smoke"
msgstr "一缕烟柱"

#: script/events/road.js:893
msgid "a column of smoke stands off to one side, too straight and too steady to be a fire."
msgstr "一缕烟柱立在一旁，太直太稳，不像是篝火。"

#: script/events/road.js:897
msgid "a column of smoke stands too straight to be a fire"
msgstr "一缕烟柱太直，不像是篝火"

#: script/outside.js:891
msgid "a concerned face"
msgstr "一张担忧的脸"

#: script/outside.js:239
msgid "a convoy lurches in, equal parts worry and hope."
msgstr "车队历经磨难来到了小镇，怀着和担忧同等的希望"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:160
msgid "a corridor runs off at an angle that does not match the stair."
msgstr "一条走廊以一个与楼梯不符的角度延伸出去。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7047
msgid "A Crashed Ship"
msgstr "坠毁星舰"

#: script/outside.js:806
msgid "A Crowded Encampment"
msgstr "一处拥挤的营地"

#: script/outside.js:127
#: script/outside.js:160
msgid "a crudely made charm"
msgstr "做工粗糙的符咒"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3619
msgid "a crystal cut with four faces, in a socket at the apex where the walls meet."
msgstr "一枚切割出四个面的水晶，嵌在墙壁交汇处顶端的凹槽里。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3606
msgid "a crystal, cut as a cube, sitting in a socket that was made for it."
msgstr "一枚切割成立方体的水晶，安放在为它量身打造的凹槽里。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3526
msgid "a cube because a cube is what you build when a thing has to be the same from every side, and be seen to be."
msgstr "之所以是立方体，是因为当一件事物必须从每一面看起来都一样、并且要让人看出来时，人们就会建造立方体。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3455
msgid "a cube. a tetrahedron. a sphere. all three older than the wanderers, and all three used since for something the wanderers needed."
msgstr "一个立方体。一个四面体。一个球体。三者都比流浪者更古老，此后又都被用来满足流浪者的某种需要。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1708
msgid "a curing fire, and racks enough for forty"
msgstr "一炉腌制用的火，还有足够挂四十份肉的架子"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3120
msgid "a cut in the ground, forty feet of readable layers"
msgstr "地面上一道切口，十二米可辨读的地层"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1450
msgid "A Cyborg Bear"
msgstr "一头改造熊"

#: script/village.js:182
msgid "a cyborg bear comes through the fence without appearing to notice the fence."
msgstr "一头改造熊穿过栅栏，仿佛根本没注意到栅栏的存在。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3752
msgid "A Damp Cave"
msgstr "潮湿洞穴"

#: script/room.js:1539
msgid "A Dark Room was written by Michael Townsend for Doublespeak Games in 2013. It is open-source."
msgstr "《暗室》由迈克尔·汤森于2013年为Doublespeak Games编写。它是开源的。"

#: script/room.js:1344
#: script/room.js:1477
msgid "A Darker Room"
msgstr "更暗之室"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4184
msgid "A Deserted Town"
msgstr "沙漠小镇"

#: script/path.js:186
msgid "a desperate weapon for desperate men."
msgstr "绝望之人的绝望武器。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7496
msgid "A Destroyed Village"
msgstr "被摧毁的村落"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7500
msgid "a destroyed village lies in the dust."
msgstr "村落的废墟掩盖着一层尘土"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1993
msgid "a disc of the same stone the temple is cut from is put into your hand. it has the three eyes on one face and nothing on the other."
msgstr "一枚与神庙同种石料切成的圆盘被放进你手中。一面刻着三只眼睛，另一面什么都没有。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2339
msgid "a door set into the ground, and no dust on the threshold"
msgstr "一扇嵌在地面的门，门槛上没有灰尘"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1094
msgid "a door standing open in a wall with nothing on the other side of it."
msgstr "一扇门在墙上敞开着，另一侧什么都没有。"

#: script/lab.js:328
msgid "a door with a window at standing height, and a bar across the outside."
msgstr "一扇门，窗口开在站立视线的高度，外面横着一根门闩。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:726
msgid "a dropped stone does not make a sound and does not come back up."
msgstr "投下的石子没有声响，也不会浮上来。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:49
msgid "A Dust Wretch"
msgstr "一个尘土可怜虫"

#: script/path.js:33
#: script/path.js:339
msgid "A Dusty Path"
msgstr "漫漫尘途"

#: script/events/executioner.js:440
msgid "a dusty researcher clumsily hides in the shadows."
msgstr "一位满身尘土的研究员笨拙地躲在阴影里。"

#: script/lab.js:323
msgid "a faint scent of smoke, and under it something organic."
msgstr "一丝淡淡的烟味，其下还有某种有机物的气息。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:930
msgid "A Feral Terror"
msgstr "凶怪"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6544
msgid "a few belongings rest against the walls."
msgstr "墙边有些东西"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1745
msgid "a few dusty corpses can be seen further down, but this deck appears to have been spared most of the combat."
msgstr "更远处能看到几具蒙尘的尸体，但这层甲板似乎大多幸免于战火。"

#: script/events/road.js:1550
msgid "a few hundred paces along it the kneeling stops, all at once, in a clean line."
msgstr "沿着它走几百步，跪着的身影会突然全部停止，止于一条清晰的界线。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6585
msgid "a few items are scattered on the ground."
msgstr "地上散落着少许物品"

#: script/events/road.js:762
msgid "a few minutes at this distance is survivable. more is not."
msgstr "在这个距离停留几分钟还能活命。更久就不行了。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:932
msgid "a few of the racks are not empty."
msgstr "有几个架子并非空的。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1357
msgid "a few useful items can be scavenged."
msgstr "可以从中拾取一些有用的物品。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4652
msgid "a fight, maybe."
msgstr "也许是在打架"

#: script/events/outside.js:109
msgid "a fire has started"
msgstr "火灾已经开始"

#: script/events/outside.js:104
msgid "a fire rampages through one of the huts, destroying it."
msgstr "火焰吞噬了一间屋子，将它摧毁殆尽"

#: script/room.js:1477
msgid "A Firelit Room"
msgstr "生火间"

#: script/path.js:177
msgid "a fleet mark. the emblem of a society that is not there any more."
msgstr "一枚舰队标记。一个已不复存在的社会的徽章。"

#: script/lab.js:311
msgid "a floor drain, and a faint slope in the concrete leading to it."
msgstr "一个地漏，混凝土地面朝它微微倾斜。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6963
msgid "A Forgotten Battlefield"
msgstr "被遗忘的战场"

#: script/events/outside.js:911
msgid "a foundation trench at the edge of the village turns up a marker stone, set upright and deliberate."
msgstr "村落边缘的一条地基沟渠中挖出一块界石，立得笔直，显然是刻意为之。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5224
msgid "a frail man stands defiantly, blocking the path."
msgstr "一个虚弱的男人拦在路的中央"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:438
msgid "a gallery of alcoves, each holding a shape that is almost a person and is not."
msgstr "一条壁龛长廊，每一个壁龛里都立着一个近似人形却并非人的东西。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:194
msgid "A Gaunt Human"
msgstr "一个憔悴的人类"

#: script/events/encounters.js:226
msgid "a gaunt human approaches, a crazed look in his eye. there is blood upon their teeth."
msgstr "一个憔悴的人类走近，眼神狂乱，牙齿上沾着血。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4028
msgid "a giant lizard shambles forward"
msgstr "一头洞穴蜥蜴跌跌撞撞地袭来"

#: script/events/encounters.js:478
msgid "A Glass Wolf"
msgstr "一头玻璃狼"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2123
msgid "A Glassed Crater"
msgstr "一座玻璃化陨坑"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1594
msgid "a glyph lock bars the last door"
msgstr "一把符文锁挡住了最后一扇门"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2683
msgid "a glyph lock, the same as the ruins"
msgstr "一把符文锁，与废墟中的那把一样"

#: script/events/road.js:285
msgid "a good deal of distance is covered by somebody who was not trying to cover it."
msgstr "相当长的一段距离，是被一个并非有意赶路的人走完的。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1317
msgid "A Grafted Colossus"
msgstr "一具嫁接巨像"

#: script/events/outside.js:915
msgid "a grave marker is found under the village"
msgstr "在村落地下发现了一块墓碑"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2776
msgid "A Graveyard"
msgstr "一座墓园"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2788
msgid "a graveyard, built over older graveyards"
msgstr "一座墓园，建在更古老的墓园之上"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4273
msgid "a green cross barely visible behind grimy windows."
msgstr "绿草在肮脏的窗户后几乎看不见"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7235
msgid "a grizzled soldier attacks, a trophy blade at his hip alongside the bayonet."
msgstr "一名灰发老兵发起攻击，腰间除刺刀外还挂着一柄战利品刀。"

#: script/events/outside.js:566
msgid "a gunshot rings through the trees."
msgstr "枪声啸过树林"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:931
msgid "a hall of racks, most of them empty, all of them the right shape to hold something that is gone."
msgstr "一座陈列着架子的大厅，大多空着，形状都恰好适合容纳某个已经消失的东西。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3524
msgid "a hall, and in the middle of it, on a plinth, a bar of metal in a case that is still holding vacuum."
msgstr "一座大厅，正中央的基座上，一根金属棒被封在仍保持真空的展示柜中。"

#: script/fabricator.js:57
msgid "a handful of hypos. life in a vial."
msgstr "几支注射器。瓶中的生命。"

#: script/space.js:570
msgid "a hatch you have never seen opens in the console housing."
msgstr "控制台外壳上打开了一个你从未见过的舱口。"

#: script/room.js:470
msgid "a haze falls over the village as the steelworks fires up"
msgstr "炼钢坊开工后，一缕黑烟飘向村庄上空"

#: script/events/encounters.js:115
msgid "a heavy armoured thing drags itself across the field."
msgstr "一个身披重甲的东西拖着身体穿过田野。"

#: script/graveyard.js:59
msgid "a heavy stone, laid flat, the way you weight something you do not want disturbed."
msgstr "一块沉重的石头，平放着，就像人们压住不想被打扰的东西那样。"

#: script/events/road.js:1093
msgid "a hold gives out at head height and the catch is made with one arm and a lot of luck."
msgstr "一个头顶高度的支点松脱了，全靠一条手臂和不少运气才抓住。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:797
msgid "A Hollow Monk"
msgstr "一位空心僧侣"

#: script/events/executioner.js:252
msgid "a huge arthropod lunges from the shadows, its mandibles thrashing."
msgstr "一只巨大的节肢生物从阴影中猛扑而出，上颚剧烈地开合着。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7017
msgid "A Huge Borehole"
msgstr "巨坑"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7021
msgid "a huge hole is cut deep into the earth, evidence of the past harvest."
msgstr "地球上裂开的一个大洞，远古时代的遗迹"

#: script/events/encounters.js:673
msgid "A Huge Lizard"
msgstr "巨蜥"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5079
msgid "a huge lizard scrambles up out of the darkness of an old metro station."
msgstr "一只巨蜥从废弃地铁站的黑暗中爬出"

#: script/outside.js:1361
msgid "a human is drawn in by the light and warmth of the fire. they look at you, point and call you wanderer."
msgstr "一个人类被篝火的光与暖吸引而来。他们看着你，指着你，称你为流浪者。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1042
msgid "a human soldier still fighting a war they have long lost."
msgstr "一名人类士兵，仍在打一场早已输掉的战争。"

#: script/room.js:156
msgid "a hut comes down and goes back up in steel. it does not creak in the wind."
msgstr "一间小屋被拆除，又以钢铁重建。它在风中不再吱呀作响。"

#: script/lab.js:315
msgid "a jar of teeth and examination notes in weird glyphs."
msgstr "一罐牙齿，还有用奇异符文写成的检查记录。"

#: script/outside.js:1582
msgid "a journal on the battlefield next to a dead wanderer speaks of a wanderer empire that stretches across the stars. they had unique powers."
msgstr "战场上一具流浪者尸体旁的日志提到一个横跨群星的流浪者帝国。他们拥有独特的力量。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:670
msgid "a junction where four corridors meet, and all four are the same corridor."
msgstr "一个四条走廊交汇的路口，而这四条走廊其实是同一条走廊。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3451
msgid "a junction, and three ways off it, and each one ends in a shape you can see from here."
msgstr "一个路口，分出三条岔路，每一条的尽头都是一个从这里就能看见的形状。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3994
msgid "a large beast charges out of the dark"
msgstr "一头巨兽冲出黑暗"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5742
msgid "a large bird nests at the top of the stairs."
msgstr "一只大鸟栖息在楼梯的顶部"

#: script/outside.js:822
msgid "A Large City"
msgstr "一座大城"

#: script/events/encounters.js:631
msgid "a large creature attacks, claws freshly bloodied"
msgstr "一只巨大的生物袭来，爪子上鲜血淋漓"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7464
msgid "a large creature lunges, muscles rippling in the torchlight"
msgstr "一只巨大的生物吼叫了一声，肌肉在火光中起伏着"

#: script/outside.js:804
msgid "A Large Encampment"
msgstr "一处大型营地"

#: script/events/executioner.js:667
msgid "a large hatch grinds open, and the wind rushes in."
msgstr "一扇大舱门吱嘎打开，风灌了进来。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:690
msgid "a large hatch opens into a wide corridor."
msgstr "一扇大舱门通向一条宽阔的走廊。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5869
msgid "a large man attacks, waving a bayonet."
msgstr "一个彪形大汉挥舞着刺刀袭来"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5030
msgid "a large shanty town sprawls across the streets."
msgstr "街道上的帐篷一望无际"

#: script/outside.js:818
msgid "A Large Village"
msgstr "大型村落"

#: script/lab.js:341
msgid "a ledger of numbers, no names. the numbers run to five figures."
msgstr "一本只有数字、没有姓名的账簿。数字达到五位数。"

#: script/events/room.js:1071
msgid "a life brutally ended"
msgstr "一条被残忍终结的生命"

#: script/events/path.js:278
msgid "a line of marked stones runs out towards the flats"
msgstr "一列有标记的石头向平原延伸而去"

#: script/events/road.js:148
msgid "a line of snares runs across the slope, set by somebody who knew what they were doing."
msgstr "一排陷阱沿着山坡布设，设陷者显然深谙此道。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3376
msgid "A Locked-Down Prison"
msgstr "一座封锁的监狱"

#: script/events/road.js:1648
msgid "a log kept daily for eleven years"
msgstr "一本连续十一年每日记录的日志"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:40
msgid "a lone frog sits in the muck, silently."
msgstr "一只孤独的蛙蹲坐在淤泥中，一言不发"

#: script/outside.js:812
msgid "A Lonely Hut"
msgstr "孤独小屋"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:615
msgid "a long room, entirely empty, with a single chair at the far end facing away."
msgstr "一间狭长的空房间，尽头孤零零一把椅子，背对着门口。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1047
msgid "A madman"
msgstr "一个疯子"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4484
msgid "a madman attacks, screeching."
msgstr "一个男人疯狂地尖叫着发起了攻击"

#: script/events/executioner.js:598
msgid "a maintenance panel is embedded in the wall next to a large sealed door."
msgstr "一块维护面板嵌在一扇密封大门旁的墙上。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6930
msgid "a man charges down the hall, a rusty blade in his hand"
msgstr "一个男人冲进大厅，手里拿着一块生锈的刀片"

#: script/events/path.js:529
msgid "A Man Going Out"
msgstr "一个外出的男人"

#: script/events/room.js:966
msgid "a man hobbles up, coughing."
msgstr "男子咳嗽着，一瘸一拐地走了过来"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7305
#: script/events/setpieces.js:7339
msgid "a man joins the fight"
msgstr "一个男人加入了战斗"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4772
msgid "a man stands over a dead wanderer. notices he's not alone."
msgstr "一个人站在一个流浪者的尸体旁边。他不是一个人"

#: script/events/encounters.js:599
msgid "A Man-Eater"
msgstr "食人怪"

#: script/events/road.js:561
#: script/events/road.js:568
msgid "a mark goes on the underside of the stone, at the end of the list."
msgstr "一个标记刻在石头背面，列在名单末尾。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5963
msgid "a masked soldier rounds the corner, gun drawn"
msgstr "一个蒙面士兵跑过拐角，拔出了枪"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1494
msgid "A Mech Warrior"
msgstr "一名机甲战士"

#: script/events/executioner.js:86
msgid "a medical drone wheels out of control."
msgstr "一台医疗无人机失控打转。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7078
msgid "a military perimeter is set up around the mine."
msgstr "矿井周围设立了军事边界"

#: script/events/outside.js:553
msgid "A Military Raid"
msgstr "武装力量突袭"

#: script/events/executioner.js:46
msgid "a mobile defence platform trundles around the corner."
msgstr "一台移动防御平台从拐角处隆隆驶来。"

#: script/outside.js:802
msgid "A Modest Encampment"
msgstr "一处简朴的营地"

#: script/outside.js:816
msgid "A Modest Village"
msgstr "中型村落"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1974
msgid "a monk inclines its head very slightly. that appears to be the entire ceremony."
msgstr "一位僧侣微微低头。这似乎就是整套仪式。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2758
msgid "a monk. three eyes, three ears, no mouth. it has been standing there long enough that it did not arrive."
msgstr "一位僧侣。三只眼睛，三只耳朵，没有嘴。它站在那里已经太久，久到仿佛从未“到来”过。"

#: script/prison.js:237
msgid "a morphing projection of this room and this planet."
msgstr "这间房间和这颗行星的一幅变幻投影。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:35
msgid "A Murky Swamp"
msgstr "迷雾沼泽"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1406
msgid "A Mutant"
msgstr "一个变异体"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2278
msgid "a mutated beast leaps from its cell."
msgstr "一头变异野兽从牢笼中跃出。"

#: script/events/room.js:543
#: script/events/room.js:627
msgid "a mysterious wanderer arrives"
msgstr "神秘流浪者来了"

#: script/ruins.js:59
msgid "a name being struck out of something that was meant to be permanent."
msgstr "一个原本应当永久留存的名字被划去了。"

#: script/events/road.js:969
msgid "a night is spent out here for nothing, and the cold gets into everything."
msgstr "在这里白白耗过一夜，寒意渗进了一切之中。"

#: script/events/room.js:16
msgid "a nomad arrives, looking to trade"
msgstr "游牧部落抵达，想要进行贸易"

#: script/events/room.js:13
msgid "a nomad shuffles into view, laden with makeshift bags bound with rough twine."
msgstr "游牧部落慢吞吞地出现在视野中，带着许多用粗麻线扎起来的临时口袋"

#: script/room.js:1535
msgid "A Note on This Fork"
msgstr "关于此分支版本的说明"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1639
msgid "a pack animal, alive, and carrying somebody else's work"
msgstr "一头驮兽，还活着，驮着别人的劳作成果"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1635
msgid "a pack animal, alive, standing in the open with nobody anywhere near it."
msgstr "一头驮兽，还活着，独自站在空地上，附近空无一人。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:636
msgid "A Pack of Beasts"
msgstr "一群野兽"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5667
msgid "a pack of lizards rounds the corner."
msgstr "一群蜥蜴绕过转角"

#: script/village.js:162
msgid "a pack of snarling beasts pours out of the trees."
msgstr "一群咆哮的野兽冲出丛林"

#: script/outside.js:1409
#: script/outside.js:1426
#: script/outside.js:1443
msgid "a pang"
msgstr "一阵刺痛"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4724
msgid "a panicked scavenger bursts through the door, screaming."
msgstr "惊慌的拾荒者尖叫着冲进了门"

#: script/events/path.js:388
msgid "a party comes up the path, carrying one of their own"
msgstr "一队人沿路而来，抬着自己人中的一个"

#: script/events/outside.js:325
msgid "a plague afflicts the village"
msgstr "一场瘟疫席卷了村落"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1172
msgid "A Plague Doctor"
msgstr "一位瘟疫医生"

#: script/events/encounters.js:999
msgid "a plague doctor emerges from the shadows with an alien and confusing message."
msgstr "一位瘟疫医生从阴影中现身，带来一则古怪而费解的讯息。"

#: script/graveyard.js:49
msgid "a plain marker, and somebody has kept the weeds off it."
msgstr "一块朴素的界碑，有人一直替它清除杂草。"

#: script/prison.js:227
msgid "a prisoner tried to repair this cell from the inside."
msgstr "一名囚犯曾试图从内部修复这间牢房。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6625
msgid "a pristine medicine cabinet at the end of a hallway."
msgstr "在走廊的尽头有个药柜"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1538
msgid "A Profane Cultist"
msgstr "一名亵渎教徒"

#: script/village.js:210
msgid "a proper military column. matched kit, a line that holds, somebody in it giving orders."
msgstr "一支正规的军事纵队。装备统一，队形严整，还有人在下达命令。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:310
msgid "A Radiated Goat"
msgstr "一头被辐射的山羊"

#: script/events/encounters.js:349
msgid "a radiated goat charges with its mutated antlers"
msgstr "一头被辐射的山羊用它变异的鹿角发起冲锋"

#: script/room.js:1640
msgid "a ragged stranger stumbles through the door and collapses in the corner"
msgstr "一个衣衫褴褛的陌生人步履蹒跚地步入门来，瘫倒在角落里"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1079
msgid "a random person runs out, swinging a spear around with drug-induced speed."
msgstr "一个陌生人冲了出来，在药物的作用下以惊人的速度挥舞长矛。"

#: script/outside.js:820
msgid "A Raucous Village"
msgstr "喧嚣小镇"

#: script/events/executioner.js:179
#: script/events/executioner.js:685
msgid "A Ravaged Battleship"
msgstr "一艘残破的战舰"

#: script/events/encounters.js:120
msgid "A Ravenous Beast"
msgstr "一头饥饿的野兽"

#: script/events/encounters.js:152
msgid "a ravenous beast leaps out of the underbrush. hunger has made it desperate and dangerous."
msgstr "一头饥饿的野兽从灌木丛中跃出。饥饿使它变得不顾一切，也格外危险。"

#: script/events/road.js:382
msgid "a recently abandoned camp"
msgstr "一处最近被遗弃的营地"

#: script/ruins.js:49
msgid "a record read out to a room that goes very quiet."
msgstr "一份记录被朗读出来，房间里陷入一片死寂。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1646
msgid "a regenerative machine hums uncannily by one of the courses."
msgstr "一台再生机器在其中一层地层旁发出诡异的嗡鸣。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:725
msgid "a reservoir of something that is not water, lit from below, perfectly still."
msgstr "一池并非水的液体，从下方被照亮，静止得完美无瑕。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1114
msgid "a room built to hold a crowd"
msgstr "一间为容纳人群而建的房间"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:392
msgid "a room of columns, each one carrying a column of glyphs from floor to ceiling."
msgstr "一间立柱环绕的房间，每根立柱都自地板到天花板刻满一列符文。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3608
msgid "a room of eleven. a vote taken by people who all know each other. the word RECORD, and somebody saying that whatever else is lost, the record is not lost."
msgstr "一间容纳十一人的房间。彼此相识的人进行投票。“记录”一词，还有人说，无论别的什么失去了，记录不会失去。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1421
msgid "a room of shallow basins set into the floor, each one holding a residue that has dried to powder."
msgstr "一间嵌着浅盆的房间，每个盆里都盛着已干成粉末的残留物。"

#: script/prison.js:228
msgid "a room where the galaxy was once condemned and later an innocent was imprisoned."
msgstr "一间房间，星系曾在此被判罪，后来又有一名无辜者被囚禁于此。"

#: script/prison.js:224
msgid "a room with 11 chairs and a 12th empty spot."
msgstr "一间房间，摆着11把椅子，还有第12个空位。"

#: script/lab.js:344
msgid "a room with no fittings at all, and a drain in the middle of the floor."
msgstr "一间毫无陈设的房间，地板中央有一个排水口。"

#: script/prison.js:241
msgid "a round wing with no point. there is no point. nothing to gleam."
msgstr "一座圆形的翼区，没有尖角。毫无意义。没有什么可以闪耀。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4976
msgid "A Ruined City"
msgstr "被毁的城市"

#: script/events/outside.js:6
msgid "A Ruined Trap"
msgstr "损毁的陷阱"

#: script/events/encounters.js:81
msgid "A Rust Beetle"
msgstr "一只锈甲甲虫"

#: script/events/path.js:210
msgid "a sack of it is scraped off the barrel lids and taken inside."
msgstr "从桶盖上刮下一袋，带进了屋里。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:10
#: script/events/setpieces.js:12
msgid "a safe place in the wilds."
msgstr "荒野中安全的地方"

#: script/events/encounters.js:231
msgid "A Scavenger"
msgstr "拾荒者"

#: script/events/encounters.js:268
msgid "a scavenger draws close, hoping to add to their stores at the cost of your life."
msgstr "一名拾荒者靠近，指望以你的性命为代价充实自己的储备。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4362
msgid "a scavenger waits just inside the door."
msgstr "门的后面有一位拾荒者"

#: script/events/encounters.js:557
msgid "A Scout"
msgstr "一名斥候"

#: script/events/encounters.js:594
msgid "a scout spots you. they could pass by. but why leave a witness who has seen them?"
msgstr "一名斥候发现了你。他们本可以路过不理会。但何必留下一个见过他们的目击者？"

#: script/events/room.js:711
msgid "a scout stops for the night"
msgstr "侦察兵夜宿于此"

#: script/events/road.js:318
msgid "a scrape in the lee of a rock, the pack pulled over, and eight hours of not moving."
msgstr "一处岩石背风面的浅坑，把背包拉过来遮挡，一动不动地熬过八个小时。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3200
msgid "a sealed suit, and the pattern for another"
msgstr "一套密封服，还有另一套的图纸"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7174
msgid "a second soldier joins the fight."
msgstr "其他士兵加入了战斗"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5913
msgid "a second soldier opens fire."
msgstr "又一个士兵开火了"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1684
msgid "a second, larger lock"
msgstr "第二把更大的锁"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1917
msgid "a secure locker is set into one wall."
msgstr "墙上嵌着一个安全储物柜。"

#: script/ruins.js:60
msgid "a sentence read three times over so that nobody present can claim to have misheard it."
msgstr "一句判词被反复宣读三遍，让在场的人无一能声称自己听错了。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3228
msgid "a settlement where everything still works and nobody is left"
msgstr "一处一切都仍在运转、却无人留下的定居点"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3223
msgid "a settlement, intact, and running."
msgstr "一处定居点，完好无损，仍在运转。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7518
msgid "a shack stands at the center of the village."
msgstr "一栋小棚子矗立在村子中央"

#: script/events/room.js:456
#: script/events/room.js:459
msgid "a shady builder passes through"
msgstr "可疑的建造者经过"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:533
msgid "a shaft drops away with no stair and no rail, and the far side is lit."
msgstr "一口竖井向下延伸，没有台阶也没有扶手，对面亮着灯。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4832
msgid "a shame to let what he'd found go to waste."
msgstr "浪费掉他找到的东西太可耻了"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2203
msgid "a shape crosses the glass without leaving a mark on it."
msgstr "一个身影划过玻璃，没有留下任何痕迹。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2561
msgid "a shape resolves out of the dark, already moving"
msgstr "一个身影从黑暗中显形，已在移动"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:237
msgid "a shape steps out of the wall it was part of a moment ago."
msgstr "一个身影从墙壁中走出，而片刻之前它还是墙壁的一部分。"

#: script/room.js:1023
msgid "a sharp blade can slay foes in the dangerous wilds. builder can make an iron sword but she knows this isn't for hunting animals."
msgstr "一柄锋利的刀刃能在危险的荒野中斩杀敌人。建造者能打造一把铁剑，但她清楚这不是用来猎捕野兽的。"

#: script/room.js:1060
msgid "a sharper blade for more deadly foes in the dangerous wilds. builder can make an steel sword but asks you not to fight."
msgstr "更锋利的刀刃，用来对付危险荒野中更致命的敌人。建造者能打造一把钢剑，但她请求你不要动武。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:515
msgid "A Shivering Human"
msgstr "一个瑟瑟发抖的人类"

#: script/events/encounters.js:552
msgid "a shivering human moves desperately through the bracing cold winds. the biting pain has driven them mad. they attack with surprising strength."
msgstr "一个瑟瑟发抖的人类在刺骨寒风中拼命前行。刺痛已将他们逼疯。他们以惊人的力量发起攻击。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1122
msgid "a shot rings out, from somewhere in the long grass"
msgstr "深草丛的某处射出了一发子弹"

#: script/events/room.js:969
msgid "a sick man hobbles up"
msgstr "患病男子一瘸一拐地走了过来"

#: script/events/outside.js:226
msgid "a sickness is spreading through the village."
msgstr "疾病在村子中蔓延"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1220
msgid "A Siege Automaton"
msgstr "一具攻城自动傀儡"

#: script/outside.js:175
#: script/outside.js:793
msgid "A Silent Forest"
msgstr "静谧森林"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1759
msgid "A Silent Temple"
msgstr "一座寂静的神庙"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3252
msgid "a slab by the well, and the same text on it four times, in four scripts, none of which share an alphabet."
msgstr "井边一块石板，上面刻着同一段文字四次，用四种字体书写，彼此没有共通的字母系统。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4667
msgid "a small basket of food is hidden under a park bench, with a note attached."
msgstr "公园长椅下掩藏着一个装着食物的小篮子，上面有张字条"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4289
msgid "a small cache of supplies is tucked inside a rusting locker."
msgstr "一份补给品被塞进一个生锈的柜子里"

#: script/outside.js:237
msgid "a small group arrives, all dust and bones."
msgstr "一群瘦骨嶙峋，风尘仆仆的人抵达了"

#: script/events/executioner.js:221
msgid "a small knapsack hangs from a cluster of webs, a few feet from the floor."
msgstr "一个小背包悬挂在一团蛛网上，离地面不到一米。"

#: script/path.js:184
msgid "a small light against the overwhelming tide of darkness."
msgstr "一点微光，对抗着压倒性的黑暗浪潮。"

#: script/ruins.js:64
msgid "a small number of them stand up, at the moment when standing up is the worst thing a person can do."
msgstr "他们中有少数人站了起来，恰在此刻，站起来是一个人所能做的最糟糕的事。"

#: script/graveyard.js:39
msgid "a small stone, and a short plot."
msgstr "一块小小的石头，一小块墓地。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4188
msgid "a small suburb lays ahead, empty houses scorched and peeling."
msgstr "前面是一小片住宅区，空无一人，徒留烧焦的残垣断壁"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4098
msgid "a small supply cache is hidden at the back of the cave."
msgstr "一个小型供给点藏在洞穴后方"

#: script/prison.js:235
msgid "a smear on the curve at head height, polished by repetition."
msgstr "头部高度的曲面上有一道被反复摩擦而光滑的痕迹。"

#: script/fabricator.js:138
#: script/path.js:185
msgid "a smooth, perfect sphere. its light is inextinguishable."
msgstr "一个光滑完美的球体。它的光芒无法熄灭。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5388
msgid "a snarling beast jumps out from behind a car."
msgstr "一只咆哮的野兽从一辆车后跳出。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1084
msgid "A Sniper"
msgstr "狙击手"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1004
msgid "A Soldier"
msgstr "士兵"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7125
msgid "a soldier, alerted, opens fire."
msgstr "一个士兵拉响了警报，然后开火了"

#: script/graveyard.js:29
msgid "a soldier, by the shape of the plot, though the stone does not say which side."
msgstr "从墓地的形制看是一名士兵，但石碑上没有说明是哪一方的。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5440
msgid "a sound comes from the tunnel, just ahead."
msgstr "隧道的前面传来一阵声响"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1670
msgid "a sparring automaton, still fully function and crusted with timeworn blood, lunges forward."
msgstr "一具训练用自动傀儡，功能仍完好，覆着经年的陈旧血迹，猛地扑了上来。"

#: script/prison.js:213
msgid "a special meeting room abandoned."
msgstr "一间被遗弃的特别会议室。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3554
msgid "a sphere because a sphere has no corner to stand in and no direction to face. whoever built this wing understood exactly what they were building."
msgstr "是球体，因为球体没有可以站立的角落，也没有可以朝向的方向。建造这一翼的人非常清楚自己在建造什么。"

#: script/events/road.js:732
msgid "a split hull lies at the end of a long furrow"
msgstr "一道长长的犁沟尽头躺着一截裂开的船壳"

#: script/events/encounters.js:394
msgid "A Spore-Choked Stag"
msgstr "一头被孢子窒息的雄鹿"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4272
msgid "a squat building up ahead."
msgstr "前方有一栋低矮的建筑。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6104
msgid "a squatter stands firmly in the doorway of a small hut."
msgstr "一个人坚定地站在一座小屋门前"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1211
msgid "a stair down, and at the bottom of it the air is dry enough to hurt."
msgstr "一段向下的台阶，尽头的空气干燥得让人生疼。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:128
msgid "a stairwell descends into ruins that are still powered"
msgstr "一段楼梯通向仍有电力供应的废墟"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2507
msgid "a stairwell, going down. the air below is colder again."
msgstr "一段向下的楼梯。下面的空气再度变得更冷。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3781
#: script/events/setpieces.js:3926
msgid "a startled beast defends its home"
msgstr "受到惊吓的野兽正要捍卫它的巢穴"

#: script/events/path.js:360
msgid "a stone is set upright at the end of the line, unmarked."
msgstr "一块无字的石头竖立在队列末端。"

#: script/prison.js:225
msgid "a stone monolith of what to dismantle and what to leave behind."
msgstr "一块石碑，记载着该拆除什么、该留下什么。"

#: script/graveyard.js:74
msgid "a stone with no name on it at all, only a date and a single line."
msgstr "一块石碑上没有任何姓名，只有一个日期和一行字。"

#: script/events/road.js:1244
msgid "a storm of powdered glass comes off the flats"
msgstr "一场玻璃粉尘风暴从平原上刮来"

#: script/events/road.js:1712
msgid "a storm stands still, with an edge to it"
msgstr "一场风暴静止不动，带着一道边缘"

#: script/events/executioner.js:668
msgid "a strange device sits on the floor. looks important."
msgstr "地板上放着一件奇怪的装置。看起来很重要。"

#: script/events/marketing.js:17
msgid "a strange thrumming, pounding and crashing. and then gone."
msgstr "一阵奇怪的嗡鸣、撞击与轰响。随即消失。"

#: script/events/marketing.js:14
msgid "a strange thrumming, pounding and crashing. visions of people and places, of a huge machine and twisting curves."
msgstr "一阵奇怪的嗡鸣、撞击与轰响。人与地方的幻象，一台巨大机器与扭曲曲线的幻象。"

#: script/outside.js:233
msgid "a stranger arrives in the night"
msgstr "陌生人在夜里抵达"

#: script/events/road.js:126
msgid "a strip of meat goes on top, next to the cup."
msgstr "一条肉干放在最上面，紧挨着杯子。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3391
msgid "a structure with no way into it"
msgstr "一座无法进入的建筑"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3196
msgid "a suit, sealed at every seam, and whoever was in it did not come out of the hole."
msgstr "一套每条缝都密封的防护服，穿着它的人没能从那个洞里出来。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:42
msgid "a swamp festers in the stagnant air."
msgstr "凝滞的空气中，沼泽正在溃烂"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5824
msgid "a swarm of rats rushes up the tunnel."
msgstr "隧道里冲出一群老鼠"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1786
msgid "a temple, cut from a single piece of stone"
msgstr "一座神庙，由整块石料凿成"

#: script/events/outside.js:322
msgid "a terrible plague is fast spreading through the village."
msgstr "可怕的瘟疫迅速地村子里传播开来"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3540
msgid "a tetrahedron because it is the only shape that cannot be made to wobble, and because they knew what they were sitting in the middle of."
msgstr "是四面体，因为这是唯一不会晃动的形状，也因为他们清楚自己身处何物之中。"

#: script/events/global.js:17
msgid "a thief is caught"
msgstr "抓到一名小偷"

#: script/events/encounters.js:76
msgid "a thin figure rises out of the dust. it has been here a long time."
msgstr "一个瘦削的身影从尘土中站起。它在这里已经很久了。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:12
msgid "A Thornback Hare"
msgstr "一只棘背野兔"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5339
msgid "a thug is waiting on the other side of the wall."
msgstr "一个暴徒在墙壁另一边等着"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4532
msgid "a thug moves out of the shadows."
msgstr "一个暴徒走出了阴影"

#: script/outside.js:800
msgid "A Tiny Encampment"
msgstr "一处微小的营地"

#: script/outside.js:814
msgid "A Tiny Village"
msgstr "小型村落"

#: script/room.js:619
msgid "a torch to keep the dark away"
msgstr "驱散黑暗的火把"

#: script/room.js:301
msgid "a trading post would make commerce easier"
msgstr "贸易站让贸易变得更加便捷"

#: script/events/encounters.js:440
msgid "A Trench Sentry"
msgstr "一名壕沟哨兵"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5615
msgid "a tribe of elderly squatters is camped out in this ward."
msgstr "一帮上了年纪的流浪者在这间病房里宿营"

#: script/events/encounters.js:354
msgid "A Two-Headed Creature"
msgstr "一只双头生物"

#: script/events/encounters.js:386
msgid "a two-headed creature appears, the smaller head, poorly attached and trembling"
msgstr "一只双头生物出现，较小的那颗头连接得很不牢固，还在颤抖"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1167
msgid "a venomous beast bares its fangs."
msgstr "一头毒兽龇出獠牙。"

#: script/events/road.js:1472
msgid "a vent, flush with the ground, wider than a person and going straight down."
msgstr "一个与地面齐平的通风口，比一个人还宽，笔直向下延伸。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1445
msgid "a victim of radiation, experimentation and bloodlust lurches forward."
msgstr "一个遭受辐射、实验和嗜血本能折磨的受害者踉跄扑来。"

#: script/events/path.js:540
msgid "a villager means to walk to the edge of the world"
msgstr "一名村民打算走到世界的尽头"

#: script/events/encounters.js:473
msgid "a voice calls a challenge in a language with no speakers left. then it fires."
msgstr "一个声音用一种已无人使用的语言发出挑衅。随即开火。"

#: script/ruins.js:44
msgid "a voice moving through a crowd without being spoken aloud."
msgstr "一个声音在人群中传递，却无人将它说出口。"

#: script/events/road.js:38
msgid "a waist-high pile of stones stands beside the track, built carefully and not recently."
msgstr "小径旁堆着一座齐腰高的石堆，堆砌得很用心，也不是近期堆的。"

#: script/world.js:734
msgid "a wall of gnarled trees rises from the dust. their branches twist into a skeletal canopy overhead."
msgstr "尘土中长出了结瘤的树墙，枝干在头顶缠绕成骨骼般的穹顶"

#: script/outside.js:1358
msgid "a wanderer"
msgstr "一名流浪者"

#: script/events/room.js:540
msgid "a wanderer arrives with an empty cart. says if he leaves with wood, he'll be back with more."
msgstr "一名流浪者推着货车来到村子，声称如果让他带着木头离开，他会带回更多木头"

#: script/events/room.js:624
msgid "a wanderer arrives with an empty cart. says if she leaves with furs, she'll be back with more."
msgstr "一名流浪者推着货车来到村子，声称如果让她带着毛皮离开，她会带回更多毛皮"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2320
msgid "A Wanderer Lab"
msgstr "一座流浪者实验室"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1356
msgid "A Warden Echo"
msgstr "一道守卫回声"

#: script/outside.js:235
msgid "a weathered family takes up in one of the huts."
msgstr "一户饱经风雨的人家住进一栋小屋"

#: script/events/path.js:246
msgid "a week of trying gets a handful of grey nothing and a lot of wasted wood."
msgstr "忙活一整周，只换来一把灰扑扑的空虚和大量浪费的木材。"

#: script/events/room.js:1168
msgid "a while, she is told."
msgstr "她被告知，还要一阵子。"

#: script/fabricator.js:152
#: script/fabricator.js:189
msgid "A Whirring Fabricator"
msgstr "一台轰鸣的制造机"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2931
msgid "a white dome sits silent on the high ground, its shutter open to the empty sky."
msgstr "一座白色穹顶静静立在高地上，闸门朝着空荡的天空敞开。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2935
msgid "a white dome, open to an empty sky"
msgstr "一座白色穹顶，朝着空荡的天空敞开"

#: script/events/room.js:1134
msgid "a woman arrives with a satchel of paper and a brass instrument on a strap."
msgstr "一名女子带着一个装满纸张的挎包和一具挂在肩带上的黄铜仪器抵达。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2641
msgid "a work surface, and on it a log that has been kept by hand for a very long time."
msgstr "一张工作台，上面放着一本长年手写记录的日志。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6060
msgid "a youth lashes out with a tree branch."
msgstr "一个小伙子挥打着一根树枝"

#: script/world.js:173
msgid "A&nbsp;Battlefield"
msgstr "战场"

#: script/world.js:172
msgid "A&nbsp;Borehole"
msgstr "巨坑"

#: script/world.js:171
msgid "A&nbsp;Crashed&nbsp;Starship"
msgstr "坠毁星舰"

#: script/world.js:182
msgid "A&nbsp;Crowded&nbsp;Graveyard"
msgstr "拥挤的墓园"

#: script/world.js:168
msgid "A&nbsp;Damp&nbsp;Cave"
msgstr "潮湿洞穴"

#: script/world.js:188
msgid "A&nbsp;Destroyed&nbsp;Village"
msgstr "被摧毁的村落"

#: script/world.js:178
msgid "A&nbsp;Glassed&nbsp;Crater"
msgstr "玻璃化的陨坑"

#: script/world.js:175
msgid "A&nbsp;Murky&nbsp;Swamp"
msgstr "迷雾沼泽"

#: script/world.js:176
msgid "A&nbsp;Ravaged&nbsp;Battleship"
msgstr "残破的战舰"

#: script/world.js:170
msgid "A&nbsp;Ruined&nbsp;City"
msgstr "被毁的城市"

#: script/world.js:177
msgid "A&nbsp;Silent&nbsp;Temple"
msgstr "寂静的神庙"

#: script/world.js:184
msgid "A&nbsp;Wanderer&nbsp;Lab"
msgstr "流浪者实验室"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1777
msgid "above the door there is a figure worked into the rock: three eyes, three ears, and no mouth at all."
msgstr "门上方的岩石中雕刻着一个形象：三只眼睛，三只耳朵，完全没有嘴。"

#: script/events/road.js:547
msgid "add a mark"
msgstr "添加一个标记"

#: script/events/path.js:291
msgid "add a stone to the end"
msgstr "在末端添加一块石头"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3034
msgid "aegis drone"
msgstr "神盾无人机"

#: script/swamp.js:146
msgid "after a while he says the same thing he said before, in the same words, and you get the sense he would say it a hundred more times if you kept coming."
msgstr "过了一会儿，他又说了一遍之前说过的话，一字不差，你能感觉到，只要你继续来，他还会再说一百遍。"

#: script/events/road.js:1787
msgid "after a while it becomes obvious that it is not a storm that has stopped. it is a storm that has been left running."
msgstr "过了一会儿，显而易见的是，这不是一场已经停止的风暴。这是一场被人放任持续运转的风暴。"

#: script/events/room.js:1432
msgid "after a while nobody in the village hears it any more."
msgstr "过了一段时间，村里再也没有人能听见它了。"

#: script/events/room.js:1724
msgid "after a while the middle one says something to the other two and they leave."
msgstr "过了一会儿，中间那个人对另外两个说了些什么，他们便离开了。"

#: script/events/room.js:771
msgid "agree"
msgstr "同意老者的请求"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2091
msgid "air whistles as the doors open. this section must have lower pressure than the rest of the ship."
msgstr "舱门打开时空气发出呼啸。这一区域的气压一定比船上其他地方低。"

#: script/localization.js:17
#: script/ship.js:191
msgid "alien alloy"
msgstr "外星合金"

#: script/events/encounters.js:281
msgid "alien bird"
msgstr "异星飞鸟"

#: script/events.js:1296
msgid "all"
msgstr "所有"

#: script/events/path.js:428
msgid "all four join the village"
msgstr "四人全部加入村落"

#: script/events/path.js:426
msgid "all four stay. the three who did the carrying never mention it again."
msgstr "四人都留下了。抬人的那三个再也没提起过此事。"

#: script/events/room.js:1099
msgid "all he has are some scales."
msgstr "全是些鳞片"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1326
msgid "all of it stops at once."
msgstr "一切都在同一刻停止了。"

#: script/space.js:574
msgid "all of it. the dog. it was the dog."
msgstr "一切。那条狗。是那条狗。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7530
msgid "all the work of a previous generation is here."
msgstr "这里留存着前代人的所有劳动果实"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3459
msgid "all three are dark. and at the junction, in the floor, three recesses that were not there before -- or were, and you had no reason to look down."
msgstr "三个都已熄灭。而在路口的地板上，有三个凹槽，先前并不存在——或者早已存在，只是你从没理由往下看。"

#: script/easterEggs.js:126
#: script/easterEggs.js:133
msgid "all three of its eyes are open, and none of them are pointed at you."
msgstr "它的三只眼睛都睁着，却没有一只对准你。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4893
msgid "always worked before, at least."
msgstr "至少目前来看非常有效"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4256
msgid "ambushed on the street."
msgstr "街头有埋伏"

#: script/events/encounters.js:273
msgid "An Alien Bird"
msgstr "一只异星飞鸟"

#: script/events/encounters.js:305
msgid "an alien looking bird speeds across the plains, talons at the ready."
msgstr "一只外形怪异的飞鸟疾掠平原，利爪已经张开。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:582
msgid "an ancient beast has made these ruins its home."
msgstr "一头远古野兽已将这片废墟据为巢穴。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3224
msgid "an aqueduct comes down off the ridge in dressed stone, on piers, cut by hand. it feeds a condenser that is not stone and not hand-cut and is doing fusion, quietly, in a shed."
msgstr "一条水渠沿着山脊而下,由手工凿制的石料和桥墩构成。它为一台冷凝器供水,而那台冷凝器既非石制也非手工打造,正在一间棚屋里悄然进行核聚变。"

#: script/lab.js:334
msgid "an archive with incomprehensible records"
msgstr "一座存有费解记录的档案库"

#: script/events/executioner.js:754
msgid "an automated assembly line performs its empty routines, long since deprived of materials."
msgstr "一条自动装配线仍在执行空转的例行程序,早已断料多时。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1582
msgid "An Eldritch Horror"
msgstr "一个诡异恐怖之物"

#: script/path.js:189
msgid "an elegant instrument of death."
msgstr "一件优雅的死亡器具。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:668
msgid "an entire pack of beasts emerge from the forest, hungry for flesh."
msgstr "一整群野兽从森林中涌出,饥渴地寻觅血肉。"

#: script/events/road.js:1306
msgid "an hour face-down with a pack over your head. the noise is the worst part and it is not close."
msgstr "俯卧一小时,头上罩着麻袋。噪音是最难熬的部分,而且并不遥远。"

#: script/events/road.js:301
msgid "an hour is lost going the wrong way around a gully, and the water in the skin comes up solid."
msgstr "绕沟壑走错方向白白耗掉一小时,水袋里的水已经冻成固体。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2180
msgid "an hour of chipping fills a pocket. staying longer is not worth what it costs."
msgstr "凿一小时才能装满一口袋。留得更久不值得付出的代价。"

#: script/events/road.js:1393
msgid "an hour of it. the pack is heavier coming out than going in and the weight is wrong."
msgstr "这样过了一小时。出来时行囊比进去时更重,而且重量不对劲。"

#: script/events/road.js:1785
msgid "an hour of watching, and it does not move, and it does not weaken, and it does not vary."
msgstr "观察了一小时,它既不移动,也不衰弱,也没有任何变化。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5528
msgid "an improvised shop is set up on the sidewalk."
msgstr "街道上有个临时商店"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1649
msgid "an ingot of alien alloy"
msgstr "一块外星合金锭"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1716
msgid "an ingot. a device that fits in one hand, with a worn recess for a thumb. and another of the colourless crystals, set apart from the rest."
msgstr "一块金属锭。一件单手可握的装置,上面有个磨损的拇指凹槽。还有一颗无色水晶,与其余的分开放置。"

#: script/prison.js:214
msgid "an office converted to a cell. but why?"
msgstr "一间被改成囚室的办公室。但这是为什么?"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4150
msgid "an old case is wedged behind a rock, covered in a thick layer of dust."
msgstr "岩石下嵌着一个旧盒子，上面覆满一层薄灰"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6845
msgid "An Old House"
msgstr "旧房子"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6849
msgid "an old house remains here, once white siding yellowed and peeling."
msgstr "一座老房子仍在这里，曾经的白色壁板发黄脱皮"

#: script/outside.js:1344
msgid "an old human is telling tales. they say the world is this way because of the profane and the exile."
msgstr "一位老人正在讲述往事。他们说,这个世界之所以如此,是因为渎神者和放逐者。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7422
msgid "an old iron mine sits here, tools abandoned and left to rust."
msgstr "一座老旧的铁矿，四周都是废弃的工具，听任生锈"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5300
msgid "an old man bursts through a door, wielding a scalpel."
msgstr "一个老人挥舞着手术刀，从一扇门里跳出"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2926
msgid "An Old Observatory"
msgstr "一座古老的天文台"

#: script/events/room.js:1302
msgid "an old receiver has started speaking"
msgstr "一台老式接收器开始说话了"

#: script/ship.js:141
#: script/ship.js:67
msgid "An Old Starship"
msgstr "破旧星舰"

#: script/events/room.js:767
msgid "an old wanderer arrives"
msgstr "年迈的流浪者出现了"

#: script/events/room.js:764
msgid "an old wanderer arrives."
msgstr "一名年迈的流浪者抵达了"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1692
msgid "an old woman, working a curing fire, with racks up and meat on all of them."
msgstr "一位老妇人正照看着一堆熏烤火,架子已经支起,每一个上面都挂着肉。"

#: script/events/path.js:571
msgid "an older villager waits until he is out of earshot, then says that is the fourth this year."
msgstr "一位年长的村民等他走远听不见了,才说这是今年第四个了。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:345
msgid "an operative waits in ambush around the corner."
msgstr "一名特工正埋伏在拐角处。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6
msgid "An Outpost"
msgstr "前哨"

#: script/outside.js:808
msgid "An Overcrowded Ghetto"
msgstr "一处拥挤不堪的贫民区"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4421
msgid "an overturned caravan is spread across the pockmarked street."
msgstr "蜿蜒曲折的街道上，一支忙碌的商队正在整理翻倒的篷车"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1130
msgid "an unfinished automaton whirs to life."
msgstr "一台未完工的自动机嗡嗡作响,苏醒过来。"

#: script/world.js:169
msgid "An&nbsp;Abandoned&nbsp;Town"
msgstr "废弃小镇"

#: script/world.js:167
msgid "An&nbsp;Old&nbsp;House"
msgstr "破旧小屋"

#: script/world.js:179
msgid "An&nbsp;Old&nbsp;Observatory"
msgstr "一座古老的天文台"

#: script/world.js:163
msgid "An&nbsp;Outpost"
msgstr "前哨"

#: script/events/executioner.js:543
msgid "ancient beast"
msgstr "远古野兽"

#: script/events/executioner.js:553
msgid "ancient fury"
msgstr "远古之怒"

#: script/path.js:197
msgid "ancient. simple. effective."
msgstr "古老。简单。有效。"

#: script/space.js:627
msgid "and it comes back anyway, the way it has been coming back since you saw it:<br>the room, and the rows, and the lights going off past where you could see."
msgstr "它还是回来了,和你看到它以来它一直回来的方式一样:<br>那间屋子,那些排列,还有那些在视线尽头逐一熄灭的灯。"

#: script/space.js:689
msgid "and on the bridge, at a station that had no reason to have anybody standing at it, somebody is standing at it."
msgstr "在舰桥上,一个本没有理由有人值守的岗位上,有人正站在那里。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2972
msgid "and something else, at the very edge of what the lens will resolve:"
msgstr "还有别的东西,就在镜头能分辨的极限边缘:"

#: script/events/road.js:563
msgid "and the one before that. and four further up."
msgstr "还有它之前的那一个。以及更往上的四个。"

#: script/space.js:651
msgid "and the thing at the bottom of the pack is still there."
msgstr "而行囊底部的那样东西依然在那里。"

#: script/ruins.js:108
msgid "and then it is gone, and it was never yours, and you could not repeat a word of it."
msgstr "然后它消失了,它从来不曾属于你,你也说不出其中一个字。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3609
msgid "and then it is gone, and the crystal comes out of the socket easily, as though it had been waiting to be collected."
msgstr "然后它消失了,水晶轻易地从卡槽中脱出,仿佛一直在等着被取走。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3622
msgid "and then it is gone, and you are holding four flat faces and you cannot say what you have just lost."
msgstr "然后它消失了,你手中握着四个平面,却说不出自己刚刚失去了什么。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3635
msgid "and then it is gone, and your hand closes on it, and you are shaking and cannot immediately say why."
msgstr "然后它消失了,你的手将它握紧,你在颤抖,却说不出原因。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3432
msgid "and then it opens anyway, because whatever is inside recognised you before the sensors did."
msgstr "但它还是打开了,因为里面的东西比传感器更早认出了你。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2746
msgid "and then the row of you. the row of you goes on past where the lights end."
msgstr "然后是那一排的你。那一排的你,一直延伸到灯光尽头之外。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2785
msgid "and underneath: older stone. courses of it, and the mouths of vaults, and older markers again below those, going down further than the digging that put these here."
msgstr "而在下面:更古老的石层。一层层堆叠,还有墓穴的入口,再往下又是更古老的标记,比挖出这些东西的挖掘深度还要深。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2411
msgid "and worked into the frame, so shallow you would only find it by running a hand over it:"
msgstr "刻在框架里,浅得只有用手抚过才能察觉:"

#: script/space.js:729
msgid "and you understand, finally and completely, why you opened that door --<br>and that you would open it again, and that this is not remorse, and never was."
msgstr "而你终于彻底明白了自己为何打开那扇门——<br>明白你还会再打开它一次,明白这不是悔恨,从来都不是。"

#: script/engine.js:836
msgid "android"
msgstr "android"

#: script/space.js:909
msgid "android."
msgstr "android"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4635
msgid "another beast, drawn by the noise, leaps out of a copse of trees."
msgstr "另一头被噪音吸引的野兽从一片小树林中跃出。"

#: script/easterEggs.js:34
msgid "another cairn, and this one has been counted."
msgstr "又一座石冢,而这一座已经被计数过了。"

#: script/room.js:206
msgid "another cell comes off the line. the foundry crew do not look up."
msgstr "又一间囚室从生产线上下来。铸造工人们连头都没抬。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2059
msgid "another checkpoint ahead, fitted with heavy doors."
msgstr "前方又是一处检查站,装有厚重的门。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1294
msgid "another door at the end of the hall, sealed from this side."
msgstr "大厅尽头还有一扇门,从这一侧被封死了。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2822
msgid "another stone, and another name"
msgstr "又一块石头,又一个名字"

#: script/events/room.js:1342
#: script/events/room.js:1383
msgid "answer it"
msgstr "回应它"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2439
msgid "approach"
msgstr "靠近"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1117
msgid "approach the platform"
msgstr "靠近平台"

#: script/engine.js:1707
msgid "april fools."
msgstr "愚人节。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:797
msgid "arc flash"
msgstr "电弧闪光"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:772
msgid "archon"
msgstr "执政官"

#: script/engine.js:474
msgid "are you sure?"
msgstr "您确定吗？"

#: script/outside.js:1137
msgid "areas where there are no stars even though it hasn't been cloudy."
msgstr "明明没有云,却有几片区域没有星星。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:954
msgid "armature"
msgstr "衔铁"

#: script/path.js:154
msgid "armour"
msgstr "护甲"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5188
#: script/events/setpieces.js:5926
#: script/events/setpieces.js:7103
#: script/events/setpieces.js:7152
msgid "armour holds"
msgstr "护甲扛住了"

#: script/localization.js:41
#: script/outside.js:88
msgid "armourer"
msgstr "军械工人"

#: script/room.js:516
#: script/room.js:542
msgid "armoury"
msgstr "军械坊"

#: script/room.js:520
msgid "armoury's done, welcoming back the weapons of the past."
msgstr "军械坊建好了，欢迎使用这些过时的武器"

#: script/outside.js:1545
msgid "arms"
msgstr "手臂"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6360
msgid "arms and munitions, relics from the war, are neatly arranged on the store-room floor."
msgstr "武器和弹药整齐地放在储藏室的地板上"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6204
msgid "as soon as the door is open a little bit, hundreds of tentacles erupt."
msgstr "门刚打开一条缝，就有几百条触手伸了出来"

#: script/events/executioner.js:614
msgid "as the lights come online, so too do the defence systems."
msgstr "随着灯光亮起,防御系统也一并启动。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1150
msgid "ascendant"
msgstr "升腾者"

#: script/events/path.js:143
msgid "Ash Fall"
msgstr "灰烬降落"

#: script/outside.js:1163
msgid "ask about her injury"
msgstr "询问她的伤势"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1831
#: script/events/setpieces.js:1910
msgid "ask about the lab"
msgstr "询问实验室"

#: script/events/path.js:577
msgid "ask about the two who went"
msgstr "询问那两个离开的人"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1932
msgid "ask about the watcher"
msgstr "询问守望者"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1921
msgid "ask for a blessing"
msgstr "请求祝福"

#: script/events/room.js:855
msgid "ask for insight"
msgstr "请求指点"

#: script/events/path.js:109
msgid "ask how long they have been out"
msgstr "问他们出来多久了"

#: script/events/outside.js:933
msgid "ask if anyone can read it"
msgstr "问是否有人能读懂它"

#: script/events/outside.js:779
msgid "ask them what year they think it is"
msgstr "问他们以为现在是哪一年"

#: script/events/outside.js:811
msgid "ask them where home was"
msgstr "问他们家乡在哪里"

#: script/events/outside.js:622
msgid "ask them who sent them"
msgstr "问是谁派他们来的"

#: script/events/road.js:644
msgid "ask what is east"
msgstr "问东边有什么"

#: script/outside.js:1215
msgid "ask what is on her mind."
msgstr "问她在想什么。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1925
msgid "ask what they see"
msgstr "问他们看到了什么"

#: script/events/room.js:1196
msgid "ask who the oldest are"
msgstr "问谁是最年长的"

#: script/events/room.js:1175
msgid "ask who wrote the last one"
msgstr "问最后一条是谁写的"

#: script/events/road.js:950
msgid "asked about the vent, he responds that where it leads is classified and that you no longer have Fleet access."
msgstr "被问及通风口时,他回答说其通向何处属于机密,而你已不再拥有舰队权限。"

#: script/events/road.js:948
msgid "asked anything at all, he answers it the way a man answers a question he has answered several thousand times."
msgstr "不论被问什么,他回答的方式,都像一个人回答一个已经答过几千遍的问题。"

#: script/events/outside.js:800
msgid "asked how long ago they worked it out, one of them says it is not the kind of thing you work out once."
msgstr "被问及他们是多久前想通的,其中一人说这不是那种想通一次就完了的事。"

#: script/events/road.js:947
msgid "asked how long he has been posted here, he says his relief is due, and does not say when it was due from."
msgstr "被问及他驻守此地多久了,他说换防的人该来了,却不说这个\"该来\"是从何时算起。"

#: script/events/outside.js:799
msgid "asked how they know, one of them looks at the lamp instead of answering."
msgstr "被问及他们是怎么知道的,其中一人只是看着灯,没有回答。"

#: script/events/outside.js:798
msgid "asked how they know, one of them says: because we were, and we did not either."
msgstr "被问及他们是怎么知道的,其中一人说:因为我们曾经也在那里,而我们也不知道。"

